# Pairs with OriginAuthenticated. A saga control verb with no credential-bound
# origin falls back to the coordinator the body names.
MODULE: ReceiverControlTrustsBodyCoordinator
TARGET: OriginAuthenticated
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a control verb acts for a body-declared coordinator when the origin is not credential-bound

--- FIND
    THEN IF BoundOrigin(hdr) = NoHeader THEN <<"denied", NoHeader>>
--- REPLACE
    THEN IF BoundOrigin(hdr) = NoHeader THEN (IF body \in Topology THEN <<"ok", body>> ELSE <<"denied", NoHeader>>)
--- END